WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.419
(Audience applause)

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:03.420
♪♪

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.839
Man:
On the northeast tip of
North America...

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.049
♪♪

00:00:07.049 --> 00:00:08.842
is a town called Gander.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.302
♪♪

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:12.137
September 11th, 2001.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:14.431
Over 200 planes getting
diverted.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:16.141
♪♪

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:18.560
Even with all the hotels in town
we've got no room.

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:21.521
With thousands of passengers
arriving at any minute,

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.273
Lady:
the town is asking for help
with...

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.524
Lady:
well anything you can do!

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.734
♪♪

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:27.110
We barely know where we are!

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.695
♪♪

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.572
I'm just freaking out, I wish I
was home.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.449
Thank you for shopping at
Walmart.

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:34.368
Would you like to come back to
my house for a shower?

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:35.661
(Audience laughs)

00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:37.246
♪♪

00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:39.456
Hello? Yes, it's me.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:40.791
Dad, I'm okay.

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:45.295
♪In the middle of who knows,
who knows where♪

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:48.757
♪You'll find♪

00:00:49.341 --> 00:00:54.554
♪Something in the middle of
nowhere♪

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:58.141
♪In the middle of clear blue
air♪

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:03.397
We honor what was lost, but we
also commemorate what we found.

00:01:03.397 --> 00:01:07.568
♪♪

00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:12.823
(Audience applause)

